      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal act is amended by inserting after section 5 the following section: “Registrar 5a. (1) The Registrar, Deputy Registrar and the Senior assistant Registrar shall be appointed by the Yang di-Pertuan agong on the recommendation of the Chief Justice. (2) The assistant Registrar of the Subordinate Courts shall be appointed in accordance with section 106.”. Amendment of section 65"
      }
