      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsection: “(5) a Sessions Court may, in respect of any action or suit within the jurisdiction of the Sessions Court, in any proceedings before it— (a) grant an injunction; and (b) make a declaration, whether or not any other relief, redress or remedy is or could be claimed.”. Amendment of section 69"
